{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛知県出身22歳の岡本姫奈です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日 発売になります。\n「最後に階段を駆け上がったのはいつだ？」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮影してる時は 沙代ちゃんだった時なので\n髪が暗めです🐈‍⬛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobVxkCuQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛いー？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "朝撮影して 大阪行きの新幹線に飛び乗った記憶があります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobSwBcru.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「このアクセサリーどこで買えますか？！」って聞いたの\n全部衣装さんの手作りなんだって！💍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "買いたいー🥺かわいいー🥺\n外すの嫌でした🙁"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobIad20A.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobaaxuAL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVも公開されています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『最後に階段を駆け上がったのはいつだ？』\n🔗 https://youtu.be/GuKqBjTvTCw?si=6K6KZZRQlnilO1VO"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『愛って羨ましい』\n🔗https://youtu.be/11pfb44LYlU?si=5KVSgPw4yoD84vff"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『桜橋を教えてくれた』\n🔗 https://youtu.be/TNHVgK7HLfY?si=HGxMPQm_ECXOkg2y"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『君ばかり』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🔗https://youtu.be/zrVg31LSLio?si=hE1ZSPjo1frx3nr7"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山の人に届きますように🎥\n改めて41枚目シングルよろしくお願いします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobE3CwZe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近の雨で少し散ってしまったけど\nまだ咲いてたよ〜🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "風が吹くと花びらが沢山落ちてきて幸せでした☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "花粉の無い春大好き〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "落ち着いてきたの私だけかな？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お昼暖かったから薄着で歩いてたらまだ\n肌寒かった〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "桜 あと何回見れるかな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日の一曲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "桜が降る夜は /あいみょんさん"}], "source": "official"}